      "rule": "R9",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The public docstring promises at most `limit` candidates, but `Sampling.candidates Sampling.defaultSchema [] 2 0 0 2 9` returns 10 because enumeration appends after targeted candidates fill the limit. Fix: check the limit before entering content enumeration and add a regression test for this boundary."
    },
