      "line": 397,
      "path": "packages/belay/README.md",
      "rule": "R13",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "“Each table content” overstates the new search: enumeration uses uniform rows in nondecreasing pool order, so it includes rows `[0, 1]` but omits `[1, 0]` when random sampling is disabled. Fix: document the uniform-row and ordering restrictions explicitly."
    }
